     Checkgroups(5L)       OS-9 (News)       Checkgroups(5L)     NNAAMMEE                  Checkgroups  -  a list of newsgroups to be affected         by a checkgroups control message.       DDEESSCCRRIIPPTTIIOONN                     If a  checkgroups  control  message  is received         then  this  file is used to limit the newsgroups to         be  checked,  so  it is avoided that all groups are         checked   when   a   local   (or   other   limited)         checkgroups control message arrived.       FFOORRMMAATT                     Each line  of  the  file contains one limitation         of the form                      <dist>   <group>{,<group>}         where  <<ddiisstt>>  is  the distribution of this control         message  and  <<ggrroouupp>>  is a newsgroup expression on         which  this  checkgroups  is  limited.  In  <<ggrroouupp>>         there  are  the wildcards ?? and ** allowed (as known         by the shell).       EEXXAAMMPPLLEE                      sub      sub.*             muc      muc.*             local    local*             world    rec.*,comp.*,talk.*,news.*,misc.*     Page 1                            Printed (22 Dec 1992)